cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code, cite CASSIE.
title: CASSIE C# graph and curve code (vendored)
abstract: >-
  26 C# files of CASSIE's Unity app at 3a3178e73e: the sketch graph (Graph,
  Node, Segment, Cycle, CycleDetection), the curves (BezierCurve, LineCurve,
  PointOnCurve), FinalStroke, the constraint and study-log types they
  reference, and ConstraintCandidate cut out of ConstraintSolver.cs.
  tools/vendor/cassie_cs_subset.sh reproduces it and applies
  tools/vendor/patches/cassie-cs.patch, which hands FinalStroke its graph
  instead of finding it on the parent DrawingCanvas. tools/cassie_oracle runs
  it under dotnet to check the C++ graph port in vendor/cassie.
authors:
